# CII-TH: Thailand e-Tax Invoice Library

Generate and validate Thailand e-Tax Invoice XML documents per **ETDA ICT Recommendation No. 3-2560** (English V03, 2025-05-15) using the **UN/CEFACT Cross-Industry Invoice** (CII) format.

> ⚠️ **Legal Disclaimer**: This library is NOT certified by the Revenue Department of Thailand. It is provided for educational and development purposes only. Consult a licensed tax professional for official tax filings. This is NOT Peppol, NOT EN 16931, NOT ZATCA/UBL.

## Packages

| Package | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `@cii-th/core` | Core library for building and validating XML |
| `@cii-th/cli` | Command-line interface |

## Supported Document Types

- **Tax Invoice** (ใบกำกับภาษี) - Code: 380
- **Receipt** (ใบรับ) - Code: T02
- **Debit Note** (ใบเพิ่มหนี้) - Code: 81
- **Credit Note** (ใบลดหนี้) - Code: 83
- **Abbreviated Tax Invoice** (ใบกำกับภาษีอย่างย่อ) - Code: 388

## Installation

```bash
npm install @cii-th/core
# or
pnpm add @cii-th/core

# For CLI
npm install -g @cii-th/cli
```

## Quick Start

```typescript
import {
  buildTaxInvoice,
  validateXml,
  signXml,
  TestSigner,
} from '@cii-th/core';

// Build a Tax Invoice
const result = buildTaxInvoice({
  documentId: 'INV-2024-0001',
  issueDate: '2024-01-15', // Or Buddhist Era: '2567-01-15'
  seller: {
    name: 'บริษัท ผู้ขาย จำกัด',
    taxId: '0105556123456', // 13 digits
    address: {
      line1: '123 ถนนสุขุมวิท',
      district: 'คลองเตย',
      province: 'กรุงเทพมหานคร',
      postalCode: '10110',
    },
  },
  buyer: {
    name: 'บริษัท ผู้ซื้อ จำกัด',
    taxId: '0105557654321',
    address: {
      line1: '456 ถนนพหลโยธิน',
      district: 'จตุจักร',
      province: 'กรุงเทพมหานคร',
      postalCode: '10900',
    },
  },
  lines: [
    {
      description: 'สินค้าตัวอย่าง',
      quantity: 10,
      unit: 'ชิ้น',
      unitPrice: 100.0,
      vatRate: 7, // 0 or 7
    },
  ],
});

console.log(result.xml);
console.log(`Total: ${result.totals.grandTotal} THB`);

// Validate XML
const validation = await validateXml(result.xml);
if (!validation.ok) {
  console.error('Validation errors:', validation.errors);
}

// Sign XML (test signer for development)
const signer = new TestSigner();
const signedXml = await signXml(result.xml, signer);
```

## CLI Usage

```bash
# Build XML from JSON
cii-th build invoice.json > invoice.xml
cii-th build invoice.json -o invoice.xml

# Validate XML
cii-th validate invoice.xml

# Explain fields (Thai/English table)
cii-th explain invoice.xml

# Show library info
cii-th info
```

## Features

### Building Documents

- `buildTaxInvoice(input)` - Tax Invoice (380)
- `buildReceipt(input)` - Receipt (T02)
- `buildDebitNote(input)` - Debit Note (81)
- `buildCreditNote(input)` - Credit Note (83)
- `buildAbbreviatedTaxInvoice(input)` - Abbreviated Tax Invoice (388)

### Validation

- XSD validation against official ETDA schemas (when available)
- Structural validation for business rules
- Tax ID validation (13-digit checksum)
- VAT calculation verification (tolerance: ±0.01 THB)

### Cancel and Replace

```typescript
import { cancelAndReplace } from '@cii-th/core';

const { cancelled, replacement } = cancelAndReplace({
  original: originalXml,
  reason: 'ข้อมูลไม่ถูกต้อง / Incorrect data',
});
// cancelled: Original marked as cancelled (ยกเลิก)
// replacement: New document with SAME issue date
```

### XML Signing

```typescript
import { signXml, TestSigner, type XmlDsigSigner } from '@cii-th/core';

// Test signer (HMAC - for development only)
const testSigner = new TestSigner();

// Production: Implement XmlDsigSigner interface with NRCA certificate
const signedXml = await signXml(xml, signer);
```

### Date Handling

Accepts both Gregorian and Buddhist Era dates:

```typescript
// Gregorian
{ issueDate: '2024-01-15' }

// Buddhist Era (automatically converted)
{ issueDate: '2567-01-15' }
{ issueDate: '15/01/2567' }
```

### Utilities

```typescript
import { utils } from '@cii-th/core';

// Date utilities
utils.parseDate('2567-01-15');       // Parse BE/CE date
utils.formatCiiDate(date);           // YYYYMMDD format
utils.formatBuddhistDate(date);      // BE format

// Money utilities
utils.roundMoney(100.125);           // 100.13
utils.calculateVat(1000, 7);         // 70
utils.calculateDocumentTotals(lines);

// Tax ID utilities
utils.isValidThaiTaxId('0105556123456');  // true
utils.formatTaxIdDisplay('0105556123456'); // 0-1055-56123-45-6
```

## Withholding Tax

```typescript
buildTaxInvoice({
  // ... other fields
  withholding: {
    rate: 3,           // 3%
    amount: 3000,      // Pre-calculated amount
    typeCode: '1',     // WHT type code
  },
});
```

